                  {
                    "value": "A dashboard giving insights on the actual financial performance of customer contracts by providing information on the income generated by contract, along with its associated direct costs. This enables the contract’s contribution to be shown. This dashboard will be issued monthly, but there could be several iterations whilst in draft during the finance month end process."
